## ⚡ WebSocket & Multi-AI Data Schemas

### Real-Time WebSocket Request Payload (`UPDATE_SIMULATION`)

```json
{
  "event": "UPDATE_SIMULATION",
  "data": {
    "location": { "lat": 41.9028, "lon": 12.4964 },
    "geometry": { "length": 30.0, "width": 10.0, "ridge_height": 4.5, "eave_height": 3.0 },
    "materials": { "covering_type": "glass", "transmittance": 0.85, "u_value": 5.8 },
    "crop": { "type": "tomato", "system": "hydroponic_nft", "lai": 3.2, "growth_stage": "mid_season" }
  }
}
```

### Real-Time WebSocket Response Payload (`SIMULATION_RESULTS`)

```json
{
  "event": "SIMULATION_RESULTS",
  "data": {
    "thermal_balance": { "q_solar": 450.5, "q_transpiration": -120.3, "q_ventilation": -80.2, "q_net_delta": 250.0 },
    "microclimate": { "internal_temp": 28.4, "external_temp": 34.0, "internal_rh": 72.1, "vpd_kpa": 1.25, "et0_fao56": 4.85 },
    "heatmap_matrix": [ "..." ]
  }
}
```

