## 🌐 Multilingual Architecture (i18n)

- **Primary Language** — English (`en`).
- **Supported Locales** — `en`, `it`, `es`, `fr`.
- **Locales Path** — `frontend/src/locales/{lang}/{namespace}.json`.
- **Required Namespaces** — `common.json`, `simulation.json`, `crops.json`, `3d_controls.json`, `ai_copilot.json`.

