## 📁 Strict Project File Structure

Follow this folder hierarchy when instantiating files:

```text
greenhouse-os-5.0/
├── LICENSE                         # BUSL-1.1 License
├── README.md                       # High-impact documentation with header badges
├── CHANGELOG.md                    # Auto-updated record of architectural changes
├── docs/
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md             # System design & physical formulas
│   └── API_SPEC.md                 # WebSocket & Multi-AI API specifications
├── backend/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── main.py                 # FastAPI entrypoint & WebSockets gateway
│   │   ├── core/                   # Config & Supabase client setup
│   │   ├── ai/                     # Decoupled Multi-AI engine (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama)
│   │   ├── simulation/             # FAO-56 engine, thermal engine, soil inertia
│   │   └── data_providers/         # FAO CLIMWAT, HWSD & weather services
│   ├── requirements.txt
│   └── Dockerfile
└── frontend/
    ├── src/
    │   ├── i18n.ts                 # react-i18next setup
    │   ├── locales/                # Multilingual translation JSONs (en, it, es, fr)
    │   ├── lib/                    # Supabase client JS setup
    │   ├── store/                  # Zustand store (useGreenhouseStore.ts)
    │   ├── components/
    │   │   ├── auth/               # Supabase Auth components
    │   │   ├── 3d/                 # Viewport3D, GreenhouseMesh, HeatmapShader, CropGridMesh
    │   │   ├── ai/                 # AICopilotPanel, ProviderSelector
    │   │   └── ui/                 # HUDOverlay, ClimateDashboard, LanguagePicker
    │   ├── hooks/                  # useSimulationWS, useAICopilot, useAuth
    │   └── types/                  # Physics, AI & Supabase TypeScript interfaces
    ├── package.json
    ├── tailwind.config.js
    └── vite.config.ts
```

